        </AlertDescription>
      </Alert>
      <p>When you apply the custom layered image to your cluster, you assume the responsibility for the package you applied with the custom layered image and any issues that might arise with the package.</p>
      <p>There are three methods for deploying a custom layered image onto your nodes:</p>
      <dl class="my-4 space-y-2">
