      <li>
      <strong>OpenShift Container Platform Hotfixes</strong>. You can work with Customer Experience and Engagement (CEE) to obtain and apply Hotfix packages on top of your {"{"}{"{"} op_system {"}"}{"}"} image. In some instances, you might want a bug fix or enhancement before it is included in an official OpenShift Container Platform release. {"{"}{"{"} image_mode_os_caps {"}"}{"}"} allows you to easily add the Hotfix before it is officially released and remove the Hotfix when the underlying {"{"}{"{"} op_system {"}"}{"}"} image incorporates the fix.
